        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the communicative approach of the veterinary team, noting thorough discussions of diagnoses and recovery timelines. Several clients highlight receiving direct phone calls from Dr. Miller with patient updates following critical procedures. One reviewer noted an unaccommodating front desk exchange, but most report clear guidance."
